SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Vamos
LOCATION:Vamos\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Apokoronas market village celebrates its Agia Paraskevi on the evening of 25 July at the springs of Pigadia below the village\, with a Cretan kompania (lyra\, laouto)\, grilled meat and wine\, and dancing until late\; the liturgy is next morning. Parking is on the road into Vamos\, so arrive before 9 pm.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#vamos-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-vamos
